        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/emmo#EMMO_4f226cf3_6d02_4d35_8566_a9e641bc6ff3"/>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">The relation between the whole and a proper part of the whole that scale down to the point which it lose the characteristics of the whole and become something else.</rdfs:comment>
