            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A measure used to express how a current is subject to temperature. Originally used in Wien&apos;s Law to describe phenomena related to filaments. One use today is to express how a current generator derates with temperature.

-- QUDT</rdfs:comment>
