        <ns1:EMMO_7f1dec83_d85e_4e1b_b7bd_c9442d4f5a64>°C⋅cm</ns1:EMMO_7f1dec83_d85e_4e1b_b7bd_c9442d4f5a64>
        <ns1:EMMO_967080e5_2f42_4eb2_a3a9_c58143e835f9 xml:lang="en">`Degree Celsius Centimeter` is a C.G.S System unit for &apos;Length Temperature&apos; expressed as cm-degC.

