        <ns1:EMMO_967080e5_2f42_4eb2_a3a9_c58143e835f9 xml:lang="en">Quantity characterizing the relative variation of volume V with pressure p at constant entropy.</ns1:EMMO_967080e5_2f42_4eb2_a3a9_c58143e835f9>
        <ns1:EMMO_c7b62dd7_063a_4c2a_8504_42f7264ba83f xml:lang="en">The coherent SI unit of isentropic compressibility is pascal to the power minus one, 1/Pa.</ns1:EMMO_c7b62dd7_063a_4c2a_8504_42f7264ba83f>
