        <ns1:EMMO_c7b62dd7_063a_4c2a_8504_42f7264ba83f xml:lang="en">A description is a collection of properties that depicts an object. It is not atomic since it is made of several properties collected together.</ns1:EMMO_c7b62dd7_063a_4c2a_8504_42f7264ba83f>
    </owl:Class>
    


