        <owl:annotatedTarget>Nailing is joining by hammering or pressing nails (wire pins) as auxiliary parts into the solid material. Several parts are joined by pressing them together (from: DIN 8593 part 3/09.85).</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <rdfs:seeAlso>DIN 65099-5:1989-11</rdfs:seeAlso>
    </owl:Axiom>
    


