        <ns1:EMMO_c7b62dd7_063a_4c2a_8504_42f7264ba83f xml:lang="en">A system is conceived as an aggregate of things that &apos;work&apos; (or interact) together. While a system extends in time through distinct temporal parts (like every other 4D object), this elucdation focuses on a timescale in which the obejct shows a persistence in time.</ns1:EMMO_c7b62dd7_063a_4c2a_8504_42f7264ba83f>
