        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An SI unit whos numerical factor in front of the product of base SI units is NOT equal to one.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/emmo/disciplines/units/noncoherentsiunits#"/>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">SINonCoherentUnit</rdfs:label>
        <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">SINonCoherentUnit</skos:prefLabel>
        <ns1:EMMO_967080e5_2f42_4eb2_a3a9_c58143e835f9 xml:lang="en">An SI unit whos numerical factor in front of the product of base SI units is NOT equal to one.</ns1:EMMO_967080e5_2f42_4eb2_a3a9_c58143e835f9>
        <ns1:EMMO_c7b62dd7_063a_4c2a_8504_42f7264ba83f xml:lang="en">A non-SI coherent can be expressed in terms of its corresponding SI coherent unit, as

    nonsi_coherent_unit = si_coherent_unit * multiplier + offset

where `multiplier` and `offset` are specified via the &apos;hasConversionMultiplier&apos; and &apos;hasConversionOffset&apos; data properties, respectively.</ns1:EMMO_c7b62dd7_063a_4c2a_8504_42f7264ba83f>
    </owl:Class>
    


