        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">In non-relativistic physics, the centre of mass doesn’t depend on the chosen reference frame.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">The unique point where the weighted relative position of the distributed mass of an Item sums to zero. Equivalently, it is the point where if a force is applied to the Item, causes the Item to move in direction of force without rotation.</rdfs:comment>
