            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A measure of change in depth over time for a specific area, typically used to express precipitation intensity or evaporation (the amount of liquid water evaporated per unit of time from the area)

-- QUDT</rdfs:comment>
