        <ns1:EMMO_967080e5_2f42_4eb2_a3a9_c58143e835f9 xml:lang="en">A measure of change in depth over time for a specific area, typically used to express precipitation intensity or evaporation (the amount of liquid water evaporated per unit of time from the area)

-- QUDT</ns1:EMMO_967080e5_2f42_4eb2_a3a9_c58143e835f9>
