        <ns1:EMMO_33ae2d07_5526_4555_a0b4_8f4c031b5652>dm2</ns1:EMMO_33ae2d07_5526_4555_a0b4_8f4c031b5652>
        <ns1:EMMO_7f1dec83_d85e_4e1b_b7bd_c9442d4f5a64>dm²</ns1:EMMO_7f1dec83_d85e_4e1b_b7bd_c9442d4f5a64>
        <ns1:EMMO_967080e5_2f42_4eb2_a3a9_c58143e835f9 xml:lang="en">0.1-fold of the power of the SI base unit metre with the exponent 2

