        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="en">Characterisation technique</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">CharacterisationTechnique</skos:prefLabel>
        <ns1:EMMO_967080e5_2f42_4eb2_a3a9_c58143e835f9 xml:lang="en">The description of the overall characterisation technique. It can be composed of different steps (e.g. sample preparation, calibration, measurement, post-processing).</ns1:EMMO_967080e5_2f42_4eb2_a3a9_c58143e835f9>
        <ns1:EMMO_c7b62dd7_063a_4c2a_8504_42f7264ba83f>A characterisation technique is not only related to the measurement process which can be one of its steps.</ns1:EMMO_c7b62dd7_063a_4c2a_8504_42f7264ba83f>
    </owl:Class>
    


