        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Analysis of the sample in order to determine information that are relevant for the characterisation method.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Analysis of the sample in order to determine information that are relevant for the characterisation method. In the Nanoindentation method, the Scanning Electron Microscope to determine the indentation area is a SampleInspection.</rdfs:comment>
