        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">a composite material consisting of silicon and graphite constituents, used as a negative electrode active material in lithium-ion batteries, where the silicon raises the specific capacity and the graphite matrix buffers the silicon volume change and provides electronic conductivity</rdfs:comment>
