        <ns1:EMMO_967080e5_2f42_4eb2_a3a9_c58143e835f9 xml:lang="en">accelerated charge applied at greater than normal values of electric currents or of voltages (for a particular design) during a short time interval</ns1:EMMO_967080e5_2f42_4eb2_a3a9_c58143e835f9>
    </owl:Class>
