        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">I_{ads}</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">The terms “adsorption current” and “limiting adsorption current” should not be applied to faradaic cur- rents that have been increased or decreased by adding a non-electroactive surfactant to a solution con- taining an electroactive substance, nor to currents resulting from the effect of adsorption or desorption on double-layer currents.</rdfs:comment>
