        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="en">CapacityFadePerCycle</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:note xml:lang="en">neither IEC nor IUPAC define a fade-rate quantity; this class codifies common practice in the battery literature, where capacity fade is reported per cycle or per unit of time</skos:note>
