        <ns1:EMMO_705f27ae_954c_4f13_98aa_18473fc52b25 xml:lang="en">From Greek anodos (&apos;way up&apos;) + lytēs (, ‘looser’)</ns1:EMMO_705f27ae_954c_4f13_98aa_18473fc52b25>
