        <skos:scopeNote xml:lang="en">State the polarity through the cell structure instead: the cell hasNegativeElectrode an electrode, the electrode hasActiveMaterial a material, the material hasProperty a GuestDiffusivity, and the diffusivity hasProperty an ActivationEnergy.</skos:scopeNote>
