        <ns1:EMMO_967080e5_2f42_4eb2_a3a9_c58143e835f9 xml:lang="en">substance that increases chemical reaction speed, and which is conserved after the reaction</ns1:EMMO_967080e5_2f42_4eb2_a3a9_c58143e835f9>
