        <ns1:EMMO_c7b62dd7_063a_4c2a_8504_42f7264ba83f xml:lang="en">in lithium-ion cells, ceramic coatings are commonly applied to polyolefin separators to reduce thermal shrinkage, or to electrode surfaces to improve safety</ns1:EMMO_c7b62dd7_063a_4c2a_8504_42f7264ba83f>
