        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">What the open-circuit potential curve of an insertion electrode encodes: measured against a reference of the same species, the equilibrium open-circuit potential equals minus the difference in guest chemical potential between host and reference, divided by the charge number and the Faraday constant.</rdfs:comment>
