        <ns1:EMMO_967080e5_2f42_4eb2_a3a9_c58143e835f9 xml:lang="en">component that closes the openings of a cell or battery container to prevent leakage of electrolyte and ingress of moisture or air</ns1:EMMO_967080e5_2f42_4eb2_a3a9_c58143e835f9>
