        <ns1:EMMO_967080e5_2f42_4eb2_a3a9_c58143e835f9 xml:lang="en">the total amount of electric charge that has cumulatively passed through an electrochemical device within a defined time interval, increasing monotonically over time</ns1:EMMO_967080e5_2f42_4eb2_a3a9_c58143e835f9>
