        <ns1:EMMO_967080e5_2f42_4eb2_a3a9_c58143e835f9 xml:lang="en">an interfacial layer that forms between an electrode phase and and electrolyte phase, due to the decomposition of the electrolyte</ns1:EMMO_967080e5_2f42_4eb2_a3a9_c58143e835f9>
