        <ns1:EMMO_c7b62dd7_063a_4c2a_8504_42f7264ba83f xml:lang="en">often represented in IEC cell designations by the letter I</ns1:EMMO_c7b62dd7_063a_4c2a_8504_42f7264ba83f>
