        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">E, U</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">The absolute value of the electrode potential cannot be measured, so E is always reported relative to the potential of a reference electrode, e.g. that of a standard hydrogen electrode (SHE).</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">cell source voltage when the electrodes of the electrochemical cell are a reference electrode and the electrode in question.</rdfs:comment>
